X11: Report the full IME cursor area to XIM

Author: Aaron Muir Hamilton
License: Apache-2.0 (winit)
Upstream: https://github.com/rust-windowing/winit/pull/4158
Backport: https://github.com/xorgy/winit/commit/bae8ebc0d59af839f53e13217ed10916d2505f8b
Base: winit 0.30.13 from crates.io (SHA-256 a6755fa58a9f8350bd1e472d4c3fcc25f824ec358933bba33306d0b63df5978d)

Rebased on the published crate, with the unreleased changelog entry omitted.
The local fallback spot calculation adds unsigned dimensions with saturation
to preserve coordinates when a width or height exceeds i16::MAX.

